Package: blockr.stats
Title: Statistical Blocks for blockr
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Christoph",
             family = "Sax",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "christoph@cynkra.com",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7192-7044")))
Description: Extends 'blockr.core' with no-code statistical blocks: the
    applied-stats-basics spine (describe, compare, associate, regress,
    nonparametric) plus an advanced tier (survival). Blocks fit models
    and tests and emit tidy data frames consumed by generic renderers.
URL: https://github.com/blockr-org/blockr.stats
